/LOW61.gif?t=1744872720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME ELEMENTS</strong><br> \u27a4 The game uses realistic graphics, combined with low-poly segments in specific parts.<br>\u27a4 Statues featured in the game are the works of renowned Italian sculptor <i>Bruno Lucchi</i>. <br>\u27a4 Developed in collaboration with a psychologist to ensure care and sensitivity toward the player </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014520/extras/LOW_Monster.gif?t=1744872720\" /><strong>VILLAGE THEMES</strong> <br>Kirisame Mura is designed to be an enigma in itself, a labyrinth with no exit that symbolizes the cycle of wrong decisions and broken destinies of the protagonist. The game\u2019s structure emphasizes this aspect with an environment that subtly repeats and changes, challenging players to find a way to break the cycle as they delve into the story. Themes of envy, ambition, and failure will be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hideki: &quot;Time has its own way of flowing in Kirisame Mura&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014520/extras/low__2_.gif?t=1744872720\" />Follow <strong>BrokenLore</strong> on our Social Media!</p>","developers":["Serafini Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014520/header.jpg?t=1744872720","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2024-2025, Serafini Productions \u00ae All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257056783,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257056783/movie480.mp4?t=1737659252","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257056783/movie_max.mp4?t=1737659252"},"name":"Br